Simple form processing plugin for WordPress. Use standard html tags to create forms and manage the submissions in the administration panel. 

== Description ==

The dForm plugin allows you to create html forms on WordPress pages and posts. Simply use standard html tags to create the form and let the plugin process the submissions. Forms can be created for visitors to contact you, to make a simple ordering system for simple subscription forms,…

== Installation ==

1. Upload the unpacked plugin to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. See the help tabl of the plugin for usage instructions

